  "description": "Free, MIT-licensed message bus for .NET with pub/sub consumers, retries, middleware, dead-letter support, idempotency hooks, deferred scheduling, delivery tracing, partitioned concurrency, and request/response. A focused alternative to MassTransit for modular monoliths and lightweight services.",
